2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Integrated\040Propulsion\040and\040Power\040Modeling\040for\040Bimodal\040Nuclear\040Thermal\040Rockets)
/Author (Joshua\040A\056\040Clough\054\040Ryan\040P\056\040Starkey\054\040Mark\040J\056\040Lewis\054\040Thomas\040M\056\040Lavelle)
/Subject (Bimodal\040nuclear\040thermal\040rocket\040\050BNTR\051\040systems\040have\040been\040shown\040to\040reduce\040the\040weight\040and\040cost\040of\040space\040vehicles\040to\040Mars\040and\040beyond\040by\040utilizing\040the\040reactor\040for\040power\040generation\040in\040the\040relatively\040long\040duration\040between\040burns\040in\040an\040interplanetary\040trajectory\056\040Many\040BNTR\040engine\040systems\040use\040reactor\040structural\040components\040called\040\042tie\040tubes\042\040to\040transfer\040all\040reactor\040heat\040to\040a\040closed\040Brayton\040cycle\040power\040generation\040system\056\040A\040BNTR\040engine\040system\040model\040with\0401\055D\040tie\040tube\040coolant\040and\040axisymmetric\040tie\040tube\040heat\040conduction\040analysis\040has\040been\040created\040for\040use\040with\040NASA\047s\040Numerical\040Propulsion\040Simulation\040System\040\050NPSS\051\056\040This\040model\040has\040been\040used\040to\040calculate\040the\040steady\055state\040performance\040of\040a\040BNTR\040engine\040using\040a\040common\040reactor\040for\040propulsion\040and\040power\055generation\040operation\056\040The\040examination\040of\040a\040baseline\040BNTR\040design\040point\040shows\040that\040a\040BNTR\040reactor\040sized\040for\04066\0567\040kN\040thrust\040can\040produce\040917\040s\040specific\040impulse\040with\040a\040reactor\040power\040of\040316\040MWt\056\040In\040power\040mode\054\040that\040same\040reactor\040must\040produce\04073\040kWt\040in\040order\040to\040produce\04016\0567\040kW\040of\040electric\040power\040for\040the\040vehicle\056\040These\040design\040point\040results\040illustrate\040several\040BNTR\040design\040parameters\054\040specifically\040that\040the\040control\040system\040must\040be\040able\040to\040provide\040accurate\040neutron\040flux\040control\040from\040powers\040below\040100\040kW\040to\040above\040300\040MW\040and\040that\040the\040engine\040design\040is\040driven\040by\040high\040tie\040tube\040pressure\040losses\040and\040low\040tie\040tube\040heat\040conduction\056)
/Keywords (08\040Jul\0402007\054\040Propulsion)
>>
endobj
